      "sourceTextSha256": "ccaa0aa5c6707495a6e4ef40f0b1b82ba02f719c3e6e739549f3a62ad9198232",
      "text": "Day 2 · After breakfast, a half-day city tour: the historic centre with the Plaza de Armas, the Post Office, the Municipality, La Moneda Palace and Santa Lucía Hill, then the modern residential neighbourhoods and new commercial districts in the east of the city. Continue to the Maipo Valley for a taste of Chile’s celebrated wines.\n\nIn the evening, we recommend some of the city’s finest restaurants: Boragó, Ambrosía, Peumayén or Aquí Está Coco for delicious seafood.",
